      <p>Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Amendment Act 2003</p>
      <p>No. 52, 2003</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the<i> Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
